/Rect [72.414 558.306 537.402 745.293]
/Subtype /Widget
/T (tooltip zref@0)
/TU (A flowchart showing the full pipeline of the intrusion detection framework, starting from the X-IIoTID dataset and preprocessing. It includes hybrid feature selection using ACO, GA, and PSO, followed by LSTM optimization with BA and WOA. A Generative Adversarial Network \(GAN\) is used to generate data for additional evaluation. The final model is explained using SHAP and LIME to provide interpretability and insights into predictions of normal or attack behavior.)
/Type /Annot
>>
